1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,300
I was about to send this fan back because I thought it was broke.
我刚才差点要把这个风扇退了，因为我以为它坏了。

2
00:00:03,301 --> 00:00:06,081
It's an ice feature on this, y'all.
姐妹们，它居然有个冰感功能！

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,320
That's how cold. Hold on. Look at this.
它真的能冷到这样。等一下，你们看。

4
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:13,560
That's how cold it gets. It is so cold right now.
就是这么冷，现在真的特别冷。

5
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,860
I can't believe this power is coming out of this little fan.
这么小一个风扇，居然能有这个效果，我都不敢信。

6
00:00:16,861 --> 00:00:18,041
Look at this.
你们看。

7
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:23,800
I am shook. I have never had a fan do this before.
我震惊了，以前的风扇从来没这样过。

8
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,720
Look at this.
看这里。

9
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:29,080
Look at my finger. It's wet.
看我的手指，都湿了。

10
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,820
Am I tripping? Is this.
是我大惊小怪了吗？这……

11
00:00:34,821 --> 00:00:36,241
Is this a new thing?
这是新出的功能吗？

12
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,620
Oh, baby,
哎呀，宝贝，

13
00:00:37,621 --> 00:00:39,401
this was worth every little penny.
这钱花得每一分都值。

14
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:43,220
It's so cold. I can't wait to bring this to the soccer games.
太凉了，我都等不及带它去看足球比赛。

15
00:00:43,221 --> 00:00:46,321
I just use it to dry down my concealer.
刚才我还用它把遮瑕吹干。

16
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,280
Baby, I need one for the purse.
我还得在手提包里放一个。

17
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,040
I'm going back to get another one for my purse.
我要再买一个专门放包里。

18
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,720
It's so cold. Look at this.
真的很冷，你们看。

19
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,560
It's dripping. What?
都在滴水了，什么情况？

20
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:02,580
Oh, y'all did your biggest one with this.
你们这次真的做得太厉害了。

21
00:01:02,581 --> 00:01:04,101
No, y'all not hearing me?
不是，你们真的得看看，

22
00:01:04,102 --> 00:01:06,801
Look at this. That's water.
看这儿，这都是水。
